One of the first things you
do is you have the right

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.420
cluster.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.520
The right worker node.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.340
And you run a couple of
commands for prerequisites

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.570
