00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.313
Now let's look at the UI.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.623
You log into the UI using IBM token.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.200
Once your in there,

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.820
you can manage your worker nodes

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.623
and look at the attestation reports.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:47.790
You can create apps and
bills for your pipelines.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.690
You can create tasks so it
can approved or denied build.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.490
On the user section, you
