00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:58.730
Now let's go back to the
application and see how easy it is

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.140
to convert your application
from its current state

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.630
to runtime memory encrypted counterpart.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.780
Since Data Shield is a
deployment time tool,

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.420
you don't have to make
any changes to your code.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.274
You make this API code from
your CICD pipeline prior

00:04:11.274 --> 00:04:13.283
to deployment of your application.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.890
Replaces values here with your
application container name

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.343
and the new name for the new
SGX capable image we create

00:04:22.343 --> 00:04:23.176
for you.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.660
When you call this API
since it gives Data Shield,

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.890
read-write privileges to
your container registry

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.450
at installation.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.940
Data Shield pulls the
current image converts

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.540
and packages to SGX capable counterpart

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.510
and pushes the new image
back to your registry.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:41.210
Now you continue with your CD process

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.303
and deploy your new runtime
memory encrypted backend API.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.293
Let's look at the changes you
make to the YAML real quick.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.680
As you can see, all we need
is a couple of volume mounts

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.610
for SGX drivers.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:56.360
You can find an example of
a YAML in our documentation.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.840
Let's go ahead and deploy
this new backend API

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.100
and perform the same steps as earlier.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.097
I'm on the terminal, I'm
deploying the new API.

00:05:08.092 --> 00:05:11.000
Once it's up, let's go to the
browser under the same steps

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.833
as before.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.470
I'm in the Cloud Fund,

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:19.300
I'm donating to Cloud Fund,
