00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.180
Here I am in the worker node.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.560
I'm trying to search for
the process here on the PID.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.313
Once I have the PID lets
memory dump the process.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.240
Once we memory dump it,

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.700
let's scan for plain
text in this memory dump

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.133
and to make it easier,
let's give him a name.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.193
But you see nothing because
the memory is encrypted.

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.750
There you have it.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.050
In about five minutes,
you go from an application

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.410
